Cell["\<\
All individual amplitudes, channels and detailed reports remain in \
qedAmplitudes, qedChannels and qedChecks in the same order as qedProcesses. \
The counts in Physical residues are channel-by-channel results, not counts of \
diagrams.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"6cdfc4df-3b33-4241-947a-d02cb60dfc2c"],

